{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_title", "source_sha256": "a1222dbc883a25d7b6576522ceb3e0f75025bd9aa21bb36ee9b77a5f02114a93", "ja": "さざ波を受けて飛べ", "zh": "迎着细浪飞翔吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3aed0c7477574e2e584966c74092b3892d4a56eafc7950dd12bbd866a3d65a8a", "ja": "周囲に比べ、自分はまだ活躍できていないと\n感じる紬。学校の進路調査も提出できない。\nそんな中、地元で公演や仕事をする事に。\n離れている間の地元の変化を肌身で感じなが\nら、紬は覚悟を新たに、ステージに立つ。", "zh": "紬觉得自己比起周围的人还不够活跃，\n甚至迟迟无法提交学校的升学意向调查表。\n就在这时，她接到了在故乡演出的工作。\n亲身感受到离开后故乡发生的变化，\n紬重新下定决心，登上了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1b3727481a61f70e082f4310f0aaf1465ebf76e900b5342b1ddb2d06d7b3e75", "ja": "（公演まで、あと2週間。今日はローカル局の番組に\n出演するため、みんなで金沢に向かう事になっている）", "zh": "（距离公演还有2周。今天大家要一起前往金泽，参加当地电视台的节目。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c6027aa3853a688fc6ee259c5fefcc92b4bf8c6282418f6d750e5066a2f096cb", "ja": "（けど肝心の紬が、今朝からずっと\n浮かない顔をしているような……）", "zh": "不过，紬从今天早上起就一直一副闷闷不乐的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "78a7b03beed1a4d200885e88931d8e6db8a31b892e2d50b0dedbecf72fcd130c", "ja": "{$P$}、紬さんどうかしたのかねぇ。\nなんだか、元気がない気がするべさ。", "zh": "{$P$}，紬小姐是不是怎么了呀。\n总觉得她好像没什么精神呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "575e79a9627280e0d93a41b236cd6106d9525524911bc29281db3a828b192836", "ja": "うん。昨日のレッスンまでは、\nいつもどおりの紬って感じだったんだけどな……？", "zh": "嗯。直到昨天的练习为止，她都还是平时的纺……不过……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "968c4d01276113b3c5256a482d570f2f02b3a52706f8272ac4987ee8c3f8de35", "ja": "そうですね……。凱旋公演ですし、本人は、\n何か思うところがあるのやもしれません。", "zh": "确实……毕竟是凯旋公演，她本人或许是有些特别的想法吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8f10be892a6521a2ea24f48a5b58124d8be9aaa7151707d9f08b27e10f309c52", "ja": "とはいえ、金沢には仕事で何度か来てたし……\nそこまで緊張するほどではないと思うんだけど。", "zh": "话虽如此，之前也因为工作来过几次金泽……我觉得还不至于紧张到那种程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1007_p", "source_sha256": "65150fa64de4728f3ec61f4bc1b7762a911a8d31bfc30585e275362810babecb", "ja": "とにかく、気をつけておくよ。", "zh": "总之，我会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1008_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "66e11de72282367f6637e580d8ec990915270cd2425ea832f8cd073fcf4f6166", "ja": "それでは、本番参りまーす！\n3、2、1……", "zh": "那么，正式开始——！\n3、2、1……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "2c5f76796f1b99d07c80ca60fd451b9cad9b71670d32c25462d40117865c183e", "ja": "はーい！　今日は我らが紬ちゃんの地元！\n金沢の美味しいお店を巡っちゃいますよ～！", "zh": "好——！今天要去我们家紬的故乡！\n一起逛遍金泽的美味店铺吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9cdb2f8d0548b306dc3999e992fc44e0483e2bced9b05c5e916eee37d8dd7e1b", "ja": "地元ですが、近ごろお仕事でしか帰っていないので……\n金沢の味、楽しみにしていました。", "zh": "虽说是老家，但最近除了工作都没怎么回来过……\n能尝到金泽的味道，我也一直很期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "a8352c5dd47d68d9501865c32afc5b7cab77a805af83666909ee01a7f872a635", "ja": "じゃあ、さっそく最初のお店に……\nあ、あそこ「和スイーツ専門店」って書いてあるよ！", "zh": "那我们马上去第一家店……\n啊，你看，那边写着“和风甜品专门店”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d47c3630f280276447c61726ed7da7fa58af2fe1a9f594c0b93fe5825a68c1e8", "ja": "あ……あのお店は、私も初めて見ましたね。\n最近できたのでしょうか？", "zh": "啊……那家店，我也是第一次见到呢。\n是最近才开的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "d200318539aab9e33b8acf4d12bfed93283544282b2261db0572277c4a3eae04", "ja": "ありさの取材によると、半年前にオープンしたとか！\n抹茶を使ったお菓子が人気みたいですよ～♪", "zh": "据亚利沙的取材，那家店好像是半年前开张的！\n用抹茶做的点心似乎很受欢迎哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8469e681d6eae8ffe337cc655cd8805d981a17cb5836138f96724f6bc5140ae7", "ja": "半年……そうでしたか。\nそんなに前からあったのですね。", "zh": "半年前……原来如此。\n已经开了那么久啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "dbbe6e1747b109646b25bbc2826258aa49fcd2ee1f1cac86c33ebcf034845a25", "ja": "あ～、アタシもうお腹ペコペコ！\nさっそく行ってみよ～！", "zh": "啊～，我肚子已经饿扁啦！\n赶紧去看看吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1016_p", "source_sha256": "65d48a7f4325dac79b6acc11be007d8fba3d12614010debc55c43fb0ead07c5b", "ja": "（仕事上は、普段どおりの紬に見えるな。\nこのままいけば、大丈夫そうかな……？）", "zh": "（在工作方面，看起来紬和平时一样。这样下去，应该没问题吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "51a650061e2ed5bdbcf831713d5f58fc20b61b10498ede3fdce6309669f7f2d9", "ja": "続いては、紬さんのおすすめの甘味処だよぉ。\nなんだかとっても、落ち着くお店だねぇ。", "zh": "接下来要去的是紬小姐推荐的甜品店哦。总觉得这家店让人特别安心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "f89f1ff3c7d8e2cbd231b57962653ad5ec19fe93f3048c766615457cd9d7fc5b", "ja": "奥から甘い、いい香りが……。\nふふ、食欲をそそられますね。", "zh": "里面飘来了甜甜的、诱人的香气……\n呵呵，真是勾人食欲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1019_tenin", "source_sha256": "9ad161c53baab6a8a32866addf0ad48cceeb5d7e19567d472eefa9cc006c59c5", "ja": "おいであそばせ。\n紬ちゃん、久しぶりやね！", "zh": "请进吧。\n小紬，好久不见呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0f8531d908855be729b7e5fb4d9cfd66af2ce4198d19adcbbe1e3aa2069582a2", "ja": "はい、お久しぶりです。\nえっと、こちらお店の二代目の娘さんで……。", "zh": "是的，好久不见。\n那个，这位是店里的第二代女儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1021_tenin", "source_sha256": "020e0e0d6439d2c7ac2dfe2ef5b98de21c514f8cf0dfab2c03a301e4af845d23", "ja": "ふふ、実は少し前に父から店を継いだがや。\n今はうちが三代目なんよ。", "zh": "呵呵，其实我不久前才从父亲那里继承了这家店。现在我就是第三代店主了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1ef0a8839088b72ccc215c9684274460b3fc047bbe4b753be0e94eed8f4e1d6e", "ja": "えっ、そうだったんですか……！\nすみません、その、お祝いもせず……！", "zh": "咦，原来是这样啊……！\n对不起，我都没来得及送上祝福……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1023_tenin", "source_sha256": "0080d682a5e0fb6b026f452cec4f3fa2537fcdcebbedab8afa366b4b371ea85e", "ja": "あら、こんなテレビで取り上げてくれるなんて\n一番のお祝いやわ。来てくれてあんやとね。", "zh": "哎呀，能让电视这样报道，\n就是最好的庆祝了。谢谢你们特地过来呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "5ba47d4345de694507594e50088be97376997d7a236b04b4a4135d60d87eed9d", "ja": "ふむ。めにゅーもたくさんありますね。\n紬のおすすめは、どの甘味でしょうか？", "zh": "嗯，菜单也有很多呢。紬推荐哪种甜点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "43e48408a943529a7135eb97de9abd30e5158ebd823b15667cbcce320772e6c7", "ja": "私のおすすめは……\nその、特製あんみつは、まだありますか？", "zh": "我的推荐是……那个，特制馅蜜还在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1026_tenin", "source_sha256": "d04f36f76129999c5d935735c80237acf050d02b4f33a7abc1590da0a12124ca", "ja": "ええ。もちろん。\n父から受け継いだ味は、変えとらんよ。", "zh": "嗯，当然。\n从父亲那里继承的味道，我可没改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "93367961ac8ae4b18f53c5df9f403dc8a8447fd18dc91f9edb989a9672d6a708", "ja": "そうですか。それではぜひ、みなさんにもそちらを……\n私の……思い出の味なんです。", "zh": "这样啊。那么也请大家务必尝尝那个……那是我……记忆中的味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "40a1d051756c13325e4e3e8ce27c66b83e5545a708b176640f55741b75b1beff", "ja": "抹茶ケーキにあんみつ、浜焼きにおでん……\nうう、さすがにちょっとお腹いっぱいかも……。", "zh": "抹茶蛋糕、寒天蜜豆，还有浜烧和关东煮……\n呜，果然还是有点吃撑了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "b8205a3810d6948c1baaca01a6e8aad7b542d8d70ec13a130495cd852c11b54a", "ja": "あたしも、ちょっこし苦しくなってきたねぇ。\n次はどんなお店だったかなぁ。", "zh": "我也开始有点撑了呢。接下来是什么店来着呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5243fb9096906589279c120ed5639c1d534b2ce9997a11e0d1331fd216555931", "ja": "次は、金箔を使ったお料理の店ですね。\nこの道をもう少し行った先に……あ。", "zh": "接下来是使用金箔烹饪的料理店。\n沿着这条路再走一小段就到了……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "b4856f23dd6504387c2a5a259f5d12a731be213a4a793e2148541362c7dbd36e", "ja": "紬、どうしたの？", "zh": "紬，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5b665831094984466c221fca98e5b224bb72292f9ba57558244bf353d8cc591a", "ja": "あ、いえ。以前はこちらに、\nお土産屋さんがあったはずなのですが……。", "zh": "啊，不是。以前这里应该有一家特产店才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1033_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "6eb5b6d844b19cd7ded911b700f42ec605dbdfc6dcacc4b9ff13ca2bcb096568", "ja": "ああ、ここは少し前に閉店したんですよ。\n店主が引退して、後継ぎもいなかったとかで。", "zh": "啊，这里不久前关门了。\n听说是店主退休了，也没有继承人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "07593c49190071d08e13af4155a33c6412a9d1c67415632ba59b7eba47cebd05", "ja": "えっ。そ、そうでしたか……。", "zh": "诶，原、原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1035_035hin", "source_sha256": "1715fb6903712a9b25240fc7cde8ee764b9279c6d22db6cfa066813406d04975", "ja": "紬さんの、馴染みのお店だったのかい？", "zh": "是紬小姐熟悉的店吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "490f3bbd122e18ec99a2e3858bb354cd08f9e7568030aec1d170234abd1f868c", "ja": "品揃えがとてもよく、こちらでしか手に入らない物が、\nたくさんあったのですが……残念です。", "zh": "这里的商品种类非常丰富，还有很多只有在这边\n才能买到的东西……真是太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1037_p", "source_sha256": "06a0a649ecceeb749ee080c5ea2c139eeae9efe8518a2bb2764f33fcfd68390b", "ja": "（収録のラストは金沢といえばのスポット、兼六園だ。\nこの中だけでも、こんなに茶店の数があるんだな……）", "zh": "（这次录制的最后一站，是说到金泽就会想到的景点——兼六园。光是园内就有这么多茶馆啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "5c02e2498fcf3921896cc13b58477b6ad5a9c990552888fe185e46f77d3c905e", "ja": "金沢、満喫しちゃいました～！\nありさ、もう満腹です……！", "zh": "金泽，我玩得超尽兴～！有里沙已经吃得饱饱的了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1039_043nor", "source_sha256": "b12076996643b836302ac2496f76044efc41a1356bf4177ce0aeb53e5c76361a", "ja": "アタシも！　でも、まだまだ美味しそうなお店、\nたくさんあったよね～。", "zh": "我也是！不过，看起来还有好多好吃的店呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1040_008tak", "source_sha256": "a1d709f7b312c7fd7558e6345263eba2c574f0d19931ca4a65ad571bc6a5eda8", "ja": "かれーにお寿司に治部煮……\nまた公演で来たときに、りべんじといきたいものです。", "zh": "咖喱、寿司，还有治部煮……\n下次再来公演时，真想一雪前耻呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1041_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e28f74bb80810ab9a3e79cc5620382d3f4d834b1ad5f49afb5eaeee7169776be", "ja": "はい、ぜひまたライブの時に……。次はこの地で\nみなさんとお会いできること、楽しみにしています！", "zh": "好的，下次演出时一定要再来……期待下一次能在这片土地上与大家见面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1042_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "a2bc26edaa2b17b1c2ead81d23a89de718e7cfef27c188df4e17f297508f263a", "ja": "カーット！　これで本日は終了です！\nみなさんお疲れさまでしたー！", "zh": "咔——！今天就到这里了！\n大家辛苦了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1043_p", "source_sha256": "3802c0390b163281a48d0630438c092f8bce2f2fdbae2b7b4f036f3884c47903", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。\n食レポ、すごくよかったよ！", "zh": "大家，辛苦了。\n美食解说表现得非常好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1044_035hin", "source_sha256": "06a7a6af4933aedf79d450ccc2e8ab4d1d0ba4792bf7265c0e55aaff1f74e04e", "ja": "本当かい？　あたしは最後のほう、\n食べるだけで精いっぱいだったよぉ。", "zh": "真的吗？我到最后都光顾着吃了，已经竭尽全力啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1045_035hin", "source_sha256": "7fa3a06a3717bf31d707083ff26df2dd91d04010e2c70616ca1f5cfd88f557e7", "ja": "腹ごなしに、ちょっこし散歩でもしようかねえ。\n{$P$}、まだ時間あるかい？", "zh": "散散步消消食吧。{$P$}先生，还有时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1046_p", "source_sha256": "ef13abfa3cd4aeebcb84629ae2f81e7bbc311cc37fe8bd42f369ed1197a80b9f", "ja": "ああ。約束通り、観光の時間を作ってあるぞ！\nただ紬はちょっと、自宅に戻る用事があるそうだ。", "zh": "啊。按约定，我已经安排好观光的时间了！\n不过，紬好像有点事要回趟家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1047_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4a9295254ddfd87ea2b7575b4c523b2def08cc26d559bbc429f5e1c42f2b6a84", "ja": "すみません。すぐ済むと思いますので、\n戻りましたらみなさんの案内をさせてください。", "zh": "不好意思。我想应该很快就能办完，回来后请让我带大家参观吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "ec0985f5e612ecd354172ff491d04d24c52701d8bc63f27dabcf597aca61486e", "ja": "急がなくて大丈夫だよ、紬！　アタシも、\nまだお腹苦しいし……ひなたと散歩してるよ。", "zh": "不用着急没事的，紬！我也还\n撑得难受呢……我和日向去散散步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1049_028ari", "source_sha256": "32f6a6f7411f2a385cc56a0a1aa4cad2a06b58ac1fa8eaf9053a45931b638e0b", "ja": "あ、ありさも行きます！\n貴音さんは、どうしますか？", "zh": "啊，亚利沙也要去！\n贵音小姐，你打算怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1050_008tak", "source_sha256": "58e32df3b88143911c1068a9132dda1d7c34863494f231ff2aa753699741f4f1", "ja": "それでは……私は、先程周りきれなかった茶店を、\n覗いて参ります。", "zh": "那么……我去看看刚才还没来得及逛完的茶馆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1051_035hin", "source_sha256": "3325a82fe5fe58b6ce3d96714ec94ef097578501e85e67395bf20c24993f6de7", "ja": "た、貴音お嬢さんはまだ食べられるのかい？\nすごいねぇ……！", "zh": "贵音小姐还能吃得下吗？\n真厉害啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1052_p", "source_sha256": "3576c112b1466e0af59c87d5a25e56b55a2cdd04a798ce8a98a87c857b6d06e7", "ja": "それじゃ、15時にまたここに集合しよう。\nみんな、あまり遅くならないようにな。", "zh": "那么，我们15点再在这里集合吧。\n大家别回来得太晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1054_p", "source_sha256": "f7bd0fea03f36628aa652dc1a643585b2a6056d9ed14f7f25f35a75ae19571f5", "ja": "紬？\n……家に戻るんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "紬？\n……你不是要回家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1055_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8e68dd0bb383b0ee2160ccf81168c103f334e38d980948cacbaa741402f74c02", "ja": "はっ！　{$P$}……！\nえっと、み、みなさんはどこに……。", "zh": "啊！{$P$}……！\n那个，大家都去哪儿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1056_p", "source_sha256": "587e1e553bda7b153dcce145a395361928ee63f4663e8d47e1c8404b92aafbc9", "ja": "いったん解散したよ。\nそれより、疲れてるのか？　ボーッとして……", "zh": "先暂时解散了。\n比起那个，你累了吗？一直在发呆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1057_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3a8558644632f8e2ef0a45d250f01738d32082136de91269222a1f9e255606b6", "ja": "いえ、その……\n少し、食べ過ぎてしまったと思いまして。", "zh": "没有，那个……\n我只是觉得自己吃得有点多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1058_p", "source_sha256": "4d22d277958fa7b59fc309460eff92224b191d0cc50fc4f6bdd655ee4738e4a3", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\nでも久し振りに、金沢の味を満喫できたんじゃないか？", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。不过，时隔许久，应该也尽情享受了一番金泽的美味吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1059_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e35cd87364198a52b88556a330c76f93bff3f7b951dea4f5ff0eb7a7c1ed92b3", "ja": "そう、ですね……。\n終始、どこか不思議な感覚でしたが。", "zh": "是啊……。\n虽然始终都有种奇妙的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1060_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4d7e76cf479f65567ef5cf5c2ea94d3a4ab92636f22b0f1c05d3581d3c5628b0", "ja": "見知った街並みを歩いているはずなのに、\nまるで余所者のような気持ちといいますか……。", "zh": "明明应该走在熟悉的街道上，却有种自己仿佛是外乡人的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1061_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dbc3be5ea93d72178c8cc35c6ceae9daf9e6d351af2735aa306b27d9ca6c9cdd", "ja": "地元のことなのに、知らなかったことや、\n気づいていなかったことが多くて。", "zh": "明明是自己的家乡，却有许多自己并不了解、\n甚至未曾察觉到的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1062_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5e356a8b8dfa00be12452e5ed1ddf6f4e743d07108e921e83c3d08c73a3dd575", "ja": "以前の私なら、考えられなかったことです。", "zh": "如果是以前的我，根本无法想象这种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1063_p", "source_sha256": "ff02215efb401b585cdb3d3397a97782d9ccb33f0559a48135cd3ba08d30b639", "ja": "ここを出てアイドルになってから、\nだいぶ時間も経ったしな。", "zh": "离开这里成为偶像后，也已经过去很长时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1064_051tmg", "source_sha256": "65033b9b25bf0709731291f2a6513e35c0e5885cd10ffab37b8e516caa341ce5", "ja": "ええ。もう私は、この土地の人間ではないということ\nなのでしょう。戻りたくても、戻れないくらいには。", "zh": "是啊。看来，我已经不再是这片土地的人了。至少，已经到了即使想回去，也回不去的程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1065_p", "source_sha256": "f82c502b01b6169410bbd9428327eecc504227ec2c1f81d1c0a88d12dee52add", "ja": "紬は、金沢に戻りたいのか？", "zh": "紬，你想回金泽吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1066_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e7a071617bcfa915067875102a9fe2329af75809cb357b59aef94bf34b60ce33", "ja": "そうですね……。将来的に、戻るべきかもしれない\n……とは、少し考えていました。", "zh": "是啊……我确实稍微想过，或许将来应该回去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1067_p", "source_sha256": "86b8f7fbb37f932adc01e88386721c9df4f9b764ec597e67e24a7aacdcd4fb1a", "ja": "もしかして、親御さんに何か言われたのか？", "zh": "难道是父母对你说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1068_051tmg", "source_sha256": "886171f474de919a5df7e3e42f427f4a563545534aa56eccaca793c5b1e11b77", "ja": "両親は、何も。\nただ、その……進路調査票を書かなくてはならなくて。", "zh": "父母什么都没说。\n只是那个……我得填写升学志愿调查表。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1069_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a51fb5d619a266f8df87387caf222bced908b3f1c109cbd9684a2a5a2404c20f", "ja": "学校で「将来の進路を」と言われて、\nすぐさま書けなかったのです。『アイドル』、と。", "zh": "在学校被要求“填写未来的出路”时，\n我却没能立刻写下。“偶像”，这两个字。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1070_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6655b8868075ba47f921df76eec6e14cbda6a4c7a954110230ce037095b830ab", "ja": "私は、アイドルであることに……まだどこか、\n夢見心地のままだったのかもしれません。", "zh": "我或许……至今仍在某个角落里，沉浸在成为偶像的梦境之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1071_p", "source_sha256": "21c434241b319dc1532cb5cd984021485b12bb86b36f1c2c9c784fde221fd3f8", "ja": "夢見心地？", "zh": "如梦似幻？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1072_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8303deac9b03a68a464f17675fb7cd98edb78cfa0db122902475519ed80fe032", "ja": "はい。東京にいるアイドルの自分は、夢の延長で。\n現実の自分は、まだ金沢の高校生でいるような……。", "zh": "是的。在东京成为偶像的自己，就像是梦境的延续。\n而现实中的自己，仿佛还只是金泽的高中生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1073_051tmg", "source_sha256": "04c0006ab41490c9d3a269a6b2181a72b520054d70b6d9944cfb8964b8786d94", "ja": "私は、幼い頃からずっとこの街で暮らしていて。\n大人になったら、きっと家を継いで……。", "zh": "我从小就一直生活在这座城市里。\n想着长大以后，肯定会继承家业……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1074_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6885bcc43c8558a78950116ab23ebf490c17811bbfa43da3f90bc74aae54dec1", "ja": "そのまま、ここで\n一生を終えるのだと思っていましたから。", "zh": "所以，我原以为自己会就这样在这里度过一生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1075_p", "source_sha256": "c7864a6d85949ce6d7d293fb2184e68e40be86a86a85c6034180c6cdb47e49d6", "ja": "……ちょっと、違うルートになったな？", "zh": "……好像走上了稍微不同的路线？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1076_051tmg", "source_sha256": "861dc5d12b122382a59182caf1d9530e6b55a39b2b37a7bd7a9af5d43dd75f7e", "ja": "私にとっては、ちょっとどころではありません。\n未来が、全部変わってしまったのですから。", "zh": "对我来说，可不只是稍微变了点路线。\n因为未来已经彻底改变了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1077_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e46cef61d9175d7627dc306f029fc33dcbbfdb5253ccab8e22403587543db65a", "ja": "そのことに……\nここに来て、改めて気がつかされたんです。", "zh": "正是来到这里之后，我才再次意识到这一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1078_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e934163c6d14ee37ca52a48013664a6353b08bdd691c85c25fe89db01a189c77", "ja": "私の場所だったはずのここは、\n私がいなくても、時間が過ぎていて……。", "zh": "这里本来应该是属于我的地方，可即使没有我，时间也依然在流逝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1079_051tmg", "source_sha256": "abd9d9abdd06c2e61d283c27bd4f21f685b76ed1fd0c4cfbef70031698768d4e", "ja": "私はといえば……もう、\n後戻りできないところまで進んでしまったのだと。", "zh": "至于我……已经走到了无法回头的地步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1080_p", "source_sha256": "b1f0efe3041b1919e327f5b32e5cda5bfb0ecd604e0be137675606815164125c", "ja": "そうだな。\n以前の紬には、もう戻れないかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊。\n也许已经回不到从前的纺了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1081_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ec5316fe40602d1c3d4300315c08d2b7a97249d7bfbbe39144385af0336b4944", "ja": "そうでしょうとも。", "zh": "当然了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1082_p", "source_sha256": "ac2f0047798d9f7187de96be562b75a2de240aa63b89b26103280d050aa0b36d", "ja": "でも、紬はまだ17歳だ。\nこれからまだ、いろんな人生を選べると思う。", "zh": "不过，紬还只有17岁。\n我想，今后她还可以选择各种各样的人生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1083_p", "source_sha256": "255dc361801d13d3d896d28707c604353087ff06b5ccff6e04f05c055deadf04", "ja": "それこそ、普通の高校生に戻ることだって。\n家を継ぐことだって、やろうと思えばできる。", "zh": "甚至也可以重新回到普通的高中生生活。\n只要她愿意，也可以选择继承家业。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1085_p", "source_sha256": "01c70138ccb7c2417448f74cf2c85dd290475243bdbefa722f7fd8ba44daf838", "ja": "でも、そうだな。紬が金沢に戻ったら、\n俺はまた、紬をスカウトしに来るかもしれないな。", "zh": "不过，怎么说呢。要是紬回了金泽，我说不定还会再来招募她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1086_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d58b4474ea83d76f3fe45aed41bd22d0f26219c408d4be4d680b9ae499da66c5", "ja": "……は？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1087_p", "source_sha256": "7681ef22ea9d882324bb7711115c4e506ea3995ca695f45263013a7016272c40", "ja": "たとえ後戻りができるとしても、したくない。\n紬をアイドルにしたこと、後悔なんてしてないから。", "zh": "就算能够回头，我也不想回头。\n因为我从没后悔过让䌷成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1088_051tmg", "source_sha256": "11981a42a1d4fa3e1e8b1822a8ba7ec779e81eea59dff9fae8ec440ec7344524", "ja": "な、なん……。", "zh": "这、这……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1089_p", "source_sha256": "07dad6602831f98a95287b9262b7a063947b21aee0090c1743f3b5ee12683741", "ja": "紬も、そう思っていてくれてたら\nいいなと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "我在想，要是紬也能这么想就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1090_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0808377df24e3e22631fc35b3d6afb84c8c7d14f0b431f873ebdad642e71f44f", "ja": "っ……。わかりませんか？", "zh": "……您还不明白吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1091_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f2f1e55611b64fa38daddc3f49dc7ca6328a365d78abf39285e35ffc4260ec60", "ja": "謙虚なのは良いと思いますが、担当アイドルの\n気持ちくらい、理解していただかないと困ります。", "zh": "我觉得谦虚是件好事，但连自己负责的偶像的心情都无法理解的话，可就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1092_p", "source_sha256": "8bde8636cbdf072a3ef8ba3485d1ceda23103e8924d1b18ebda0873eafd9e25b", "ja": "そうか。なら、もう一度\nスカウトには来なくても良さそうかな？", "zh": "这样啊。那么看来以后不用再来找我招募了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1093_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d48c05fbada905266c519081bd6610e3be0d8c6212b475d6eb9ad80ae5d5f20b", "ja": "そもそも私は、アイドルを辞めるだなんて\n一言も言ってません。", "zh": "我从头到尾都没说过要放弃偶像活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1094_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9010c27cd638ef99be86b2a8cf9491579e375ee9a35c5d6e097369e9e3d7e6a1", "ja": "早とちりはほどほどにしてください。", "zh": "请不要再这么草率地下结论了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1095_p", "source_sha256": "f54d6db539a79038b00f3d595a5d6225450181866095977c971465ce68832112", "ja": "紬にそれを言われるとはな……。", "zh": "居然会被紬这么说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1096_051tmg", "source_sha256": "522923ab09747f57b33a7abd3748e27a9b1b21daec35d4615021a7f41e452a52", "ja": "何かおっしゃいましたか？", "zh": "您刚才说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1097_p", "source_sha256": "15468892a0b65b518399b9f340e21bfe8b79a47023e911837ab0e0364d6f840f", "ja": "いや、なんでも。\n紬がアイドルを続けてくれるなら、よかったよ。", "zh": "没什么。\n只要紬愿意继续当偶像，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1098_051tmg", "source_sha256": "73c31d9ba0472ef46ceefc85c160e07f15d5b7183382d3db041942f8da210664", "ja": "ええ。それは、もちろん。……ふふっ。", "zh": "嗯，那是当然。……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1099_p", "source_sha256": "fd5aea8620f113c5e9a5a898350ff8ac7fff5825d8dfc5aec34ab989919bbb8f", "ja": "……元気は出たか？", "zh": "……打起精神来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1100_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b8c52944875bd6d37fb06ce8e8b4ac965354d4c3310109bf3b66a9b741a2990a", "ja": "はい。凱旋公演も近いというのに、\n感傷に浸ってる暇など、ありませんから。", "zh": "是的。凯旋公演在即，可没时间沉浸在感伤之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1101_p", "source_sha256": "aa2c2cd3ea5ed465681c3a093a8aa663ce81af3d81499f8ce8079ade9e8f4ddd", "ja": "紬はこの後、実家に行くんだろ？\n一緒に行かなくて大丈夫か？", "zh": "紬接下来要去老家吧？不一起去，真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1102_051tmg", "source_sha256": "727de1d1098d48e41f66cefc88d2e815dfcedf5a98d4bff0bfb336f9b8e0714d", "ja": "ええ。今日は学校の用事で少し寄るだけですから、\n大丈夫です。", "zh": "是的。今天只是因为学校的事情顺路去一趟而已，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1104_051tmg", "source_sha256": "62f774a0bc076062907bcddace3fdb6396468a52f7647bff809dbfdcb59ed0dd", "ja": "お父さん、仕事終わった？", "zh": "爸爸，下班了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1105_tsumugidad", "source_sha256": "dec268f7d6d2b10c1ad72ce80ed94e8967c516d8ee020fa68543e5fc64f8b768", "ja": "おお、紬。\nもう終わったげん。どうしたか？", "zh": "哦，纺。已经结束了哦。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1106_051tmg", "source_sha256": "31c2458d0f3bdbaca57fffb61b5db09a1f7211725f886117b82b89f6427723eb", "ja": "その、ここにサインが欲しいんやけど……。", "zh": "那个，我想请你在这里签个名……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1107_tsumugidad", "source_sha256": "3c37efe0983c74e5ef62a78448ce0ada8284add5f23ff30d42a522f5faebda90", "ja": "お、進路調査票か。懐かしいなぁ。\nどれ、貸してみまっし。", "zh": "哦，是升学就业调查表啊。真让人怀念。\n\n来，给我看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1108_tsumugidad", "source_sha256": "31f67489e6af899d12dff551b660cc049956c37cb534e9601ea32d3427c55cb5", "ja": "……うん。\nサインするのはここだけでいいがけ？", "zh": "……嗯。\n只要在这里签名就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1109_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9de7ff85ad14db31df2fb485e3f34ac2936a699484834d1d25cf186370b0e4f2", "ja": "……お父さん、何も言わんの？", "zh": "……爸爸，你什么都不说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1110_tsumugidad", "source_sha256": "fde3abd7de5456d03f75d7b20cc294ad28e1c3f5a4fdb73202e24e2a254a2e9b", "ja": "ほんなの、\n紬が東京に出て行ったときから、覚悟しとったよ。", "zh": "那是当然啦，\n从紬出发去东京的时候起，我就已经做好觉悟了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1111_tsumugidad", "source_sha256": "a7a763dde0cad7152f24ab5ec2115867d5a47eaa955d5ff64be491845b0ff865", "ja": "紬は、そうじゃなかったが？", "zh": "䌷可不是那样的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1112_051tmg", "source_sha256": "09cb2bbe140f2aa5325d55e488d68a009647da37d97c64e2d7aeeca123818951", "ja": "……なーん。同じや。", "zh": "……没那回事，我也一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1113_tsumugidad", "source_sha256": "665c72b6e1a84e04b912c686ce20b89c25c9ae8d7a3993ae12a0936f6d310a64", "ja": "じゃ、何も問題ないじー。\n……はい、サインしたげん。", "zh": "那就没问题啦——。  \n……好，我来签名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1114_tsumugidad", "source_sha256": "aa3475a007ce6483f0c4876446fbd666def515315c997f3b1777a113597c8b97", "ja": "紬。ライブ、楽しみにしとるからね。", "zh": "紬，我很期待你的演出哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_137_1115_051tmg", "source_sha256": "689bb11e38159abdf03fe9595b0e95d726c788b978f00bbbce0676095ebf400d", "ja": "お父さん……あんやと。\nライブ頑張るから、ちゃんと見とってね。", "zh": "爸爸……谢谢你。\n我会努力参加演出的，你要好好看着哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
